{"steam_appid":1881200,"steam_name":"TRYP FPV: Drone Racer Simulator","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1881200/775323898/fd41ad9eed4892556932002671f3f2a0ca8fc17e/1766076981/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1766077573","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257252220/810f494ded2fa4b2439a564f609f4013fc0056e8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1766077573","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1881200/ss_781d0efaed458c2b172c1616eac2513a2947336b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1766077575","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1881200/ss_0ddc15e3eb22753c24ac8f215b3ddab362a41191.1920x1080.jpg?t=1766077575","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1881200/ss_6f37c29d7863f77632fd23993a0038da014994dc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1766077575","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1881200/ss_c10b995c3539f4405c4b339fcd3d63fc9e16d945.1920x1080.jpg?t=1766077575","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1881200/ss_29e43aa261c259ad40d764ed03f80fa13d36f2f5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1766077575"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong><i>TRYP FPV</i></strong>, immerse yourself in the most <strong>realistic FPV flying experience</strong> ever created. Designed for all levels of pilots, this <strong>simulator </strong>pushes the boundaries of <strong>realism </strong>with stunning graphics and <strong>ultra-accurate flight sensations</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully experience the adrenaline of FPV drone flying with no limits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1881200/extras/c1a08950e2ff4ce64c16ee31e6651aff.poster.avif?t=1766077575\" width=600 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1881200/extras/c1a08950e2ff4ce64c16ee31e6651aff.webm?t=1766077575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1881200/extras/c1a08950e2ff4ce64c16ee31e6651aff.mp4?t=1766077575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IMMERSIVE FLIGHT SENSATIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the thrill of controlling an FPV drone like never before, thanks to ultra-realistic flight simulation manage with the PID loop :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inertia and gravity management: </strong>Every turn and speed change has been fine-tuned so your drone responds as it would in real-life conditions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optimized aerodynamics: </strong>Wind effects, air resistance, and acceleration are carefully calibrated using digital twin technology to replicate the authentic sensation of flying outdoors.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic sound design:</strong> Every engine sound and gust of wind is crafted to enhance the feeling of immersion.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1881200/extras/bb40e68410c84ecbb0537a4d6eea0e27.poster.avif?t=1766077575\" width=600 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1881200/extras/bb40e68410c84ecbb0537a4d6eea0e27.webm?t=1766077575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1881200/extras/bb40e68410c84ecbb0537a4d6eea0e27.mp4?t=1766077575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REALISTIC ENVIRONMENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a wide range of spots scanned from real-world locations flown by pilots from around the globe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 5 high-quality maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through the pyramids, cross urban bandos, weave between palm trees, ski down slopes, or slalom between skyscrapers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1881200/extras/f6f07ecdf9c7b16ed77eeb60fbd4c646.poster.avif?t=1766077575\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1881200/extras/f6f07ecdf9c7b16ed77eeb60fbd4c646.webm?t=1766077575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1881200/extras/f6f07ecdf9c7b16ed77eeb60fbd4c646.mp4?t=1766077575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VARIED GAME MODES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore environments in long-range with the <strong>TRYP Mode. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your skills in freestyle with <strong>CHALLENGE Mode.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of the camera in <strong>SCENARIO Mode.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEW: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against the best pilots in <strong>RACE Mode </strong>and climb to the top of the global leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1881200/extras/6ad2a85cc73fb36d221c8ae8bcb33347.poster.avif?t=1766077575\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1881200/extras/6ad2a85cc73fb36d221c8ae8bcb33347.webm?t=1766077575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1881200/extras/6ad2a85cc73fb36d221c8ae8bcb33347.mp4?t=1766077575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXTREME CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TRYP FPV offers advanced drone customization for complete control over your flying experience:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust your rates to refine the responsiveness and fluidity of your controls.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your dream drone by selecting from a range of frames, propellers, batteries (LiPo), and cameras, creating a setup that fits you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the angle and settings of your camera for optimal immersion, whether for freestyle or racing.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1881200/extras/fe9bd1c7638b17905dc29e36d8e67040.poster.avif?t=1766077575\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1881200/extras/fe9bd1c7638b17905dc29e36d8e67040.webm?t=1766077575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1881200/extras/fe9bd1c7638b17905dc29e36d8e67040.mp4?t=1766077575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quadcore processor @ 2.4Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce GTX 960 / AMD Radeon RX 460<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 25 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> RC transmitter is recommended</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quadcore processor @ 3.5Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 2060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 25 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> RC transmitter is recommended</li></ul>","genres":["Indie","Racing","Simulation","Sports","Early Access"],"developers":["UNDEAD BATTERY"],"publishers":["UNDEAD BATTERY"],"release_date":"Jun 30, 2022"}